<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound interbank rates rise.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound interbank rates rise.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound rose on Sunday in a short private sector market at the start of the week to between 8-7/8 and 9-1/4 from seven and 8-1/2 percent on Thursday, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates were also higher at between 8-7/8 and 9-1/4 percent compared to 8-1/4 and 8-3/4 percent, the bankers added.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
